WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.580
[Gold List Title]

2
00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.120
Come on…

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.010
Sister Jina

4
00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:14.770
Oh, it’s Yeli

5
00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:17.200
You know you are the hope of Caihua Girls High School, right?

6
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.560
I wish you the best in the college entrance examination. Come on!

7
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.130
We'll cheer you up

8
00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:21.730
Thank you...thank you

9
00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:24.690
Hello

10
00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:28.340
Jay…

11
00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.200
I've always been afraid of you

12
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:32.120
Sister Jina, come on

13
00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:33.330
Come on

14
00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:37.720
Especially your dark eyes

15
00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:50.140
[Mathematics]

16
00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:10.270
It's like you know everything
Laughing coldly at my expression

17
00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:12.730
It's driving me crazy

18
00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:18.120
All this is because of you Liu Jieyi

19
00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:27.400
no one will know
To be a sister who is less useful than a younger sister

20
00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:29.900
How sad is it

21
00:01:30.710 --> 00:01:34.600
I just want to beat you
Get dad's love again

22
00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:59.420
When my father found out about my relationship with the teacher...

23
00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:02.660
He praised me

24
00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:04.530
Something I've never felt before...

25
00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:08.380
That warm compliment

26
00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:11.850
I heard you had a daughter who disappeared thirteen years ago.

27
00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:26.539
Stop looking for it

28
00:02:26.539 --> 00:02:27.250
why

29
00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:29.160
Why did you say that suddenly?

30
00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:31.720
Didn't we agree to find it at least this year?

31
00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:33.010
What about you?

32
00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:34.980
why do you want to find her

33
00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:36.289
Because I found her...

34
00:02:36.289 --> 00:02:38.180
You might be willing to accept our child

35
00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:39.980
Whether Seulgi is found or not...

36
00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:42.470
Neither of us can have children.

37
00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:43.810
Give up

38
00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:08.180
[Searching for missing children]

39
00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:09.289
Yu Seqi…

40
00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.420
[Searching for missing children]

41
00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:35.500
I refuse

42
00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:38.050
Of course I wouldn't ask for your help in vain.

43
00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.460
i am willing to pay the price

44
00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.539
There's no need

45
00:03:41.539 --> 00:03:42.740
I'll pretend I didn't hear it

46
00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:44.600
I can help you find your daughter

47
00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.890
The two of us who are fathers

48
00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:52.130
Let’s work hard together

49
00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:05.650
Sister Jie Na knows that the teacher has a missing daughter

50
00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:07.630
Are you just taking advantage of this?

51
00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:17.770
I swear I never told anyone that

52
00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:22.540
[Daejundong Valet Delivery Service]

53
00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:20.590
Hello…

54
00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:24.430
Hello

55
00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:35.930
teacher

56
00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:39.900
I heard that Teacher Kim Sun Young

57
00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:41.619
Because of breach of confidentiality agreement

58
00:04:41.619 --> 00:04:43.970
Expelled from the University Entrance Examination Proposal Committee

59
00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:48.420
Wow my great and almighty father…

60
00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.840
Found your daughter

61
00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:18.100
[Yu Seqi]

62
00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:25.580
[Probability of parent-child relationship 99.98%]

63
00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:59.200
It’s been thirteen years and it’s not easy to find my daughter.

64
00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:03.620
You probably don't want her to receive this video, right?

65
00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:09.850
Teacher, please hand over your phone

66
00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:32.270
[The day before the big exam]

67
00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:41.570
The plan is simple

68
00:06:41.570 --> 00:06:43.490
Eat the devil-level problem

69
00:06:43.490 --> 00:06:45.369
Then leave the question dormitory

70
00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:20.420
["Good-natured Competition"]

71
00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:35.590
Heavenly Father, Lord of the Living and the Dead

72
00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:39.150
We are gathered here today

73
00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:46.140
Funeral service held for Sister Liu Jiena who was called by the Lord

74
00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:50.270
We are born from dust and we will return to dust

75
00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:54.060
Believe that everything is under the control of Heavenly Father...

76
00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:56.010
All the family members are here

77
00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:58.000
You're going to be ready for burial soon, right?

78
00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:03.550
Although Sister Liu Jiena’s body will leave us

79
00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:08.510
But we believe that on the day of glory of the Lord

80
00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:14.570
She will be resurrected in a glorious body
meet us again

81
00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:18.560
We will say goodbye today

82
00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:20.440
Although it is a short farewell...

83
00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:29.910
Liu Jieyi

84
00:09:30.860 --> 00:09:32.780
You feel something is wrong too, right?

85
00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:34.170
what

86
00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:36.770
This corpse is not Sister Jina’s

87
00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:46.760
Look, she has burn scars on her feet

88
00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.610
Does your sister have such wounds on her feet?

89
00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:52.610
your dad

90
00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.160
Have a very special interest

91
00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:59.960
He will collect unknown corpses
Use them to practice surgery

92
00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:04.270
This person is the sister I met in the kindergarten

93
00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:06.540
Cui Xiuzhen

94
00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:11.060
She died because no one claimed her

95
00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:13.950
I owe the funeral home a large sum of money for storage fees.

96
00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:18.180
I've heard of these unknown corpses
In the end, they will all be sent to your home hospital.

97
00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.620
What’s even more coincidental is Cui Xiuzhen…

98
00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:24.530
Live next door to your sister

99
00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.100
Could these be coincidences?

100
00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:30.560
So that's it

101
00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.380
As a doctor and a family member

102
00:10:33.380 --> 00:10:35.280
From declaration of death to confirmation of identity

103
00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.990
It's too easy to cover the sky with one hand

104
00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:38.800
And a suicide note was found

105
00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:41.090
So seamless

106
00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:49.960
what are you doing

107
00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:53.470
Do you want Cui Xiuzhen to become your sister?

108
00:10:53.470 --> 00:10:54.160
Yeah

109
00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:56.880
Then Sister Jina will really disappear from this world

110
00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:00.280
If dad's plan is to let her "die"

111
00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:04.440
Of course let him continue to commit crimes
It's better for us, isn't it?

112
00:11:05.570 --> 00:11:08.090
If we expose him now, we'll screw up the funeral.

113
00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:11.450
He will definitely think of another way

114
00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.290
He is a person who will not give up easily

115
00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:18.160
So the most important thing now is...

116
00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:20.340
We can't let him know that we already know

117
00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.440
Let's go

118
00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:26.640
If you want to go, go by yourself

119
00:11:27.690 --> 00:11:29.010
I can't leave like this

120
00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:32.880
I…

121
00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:36.000
I read your sister's diary

122
00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.660
It says…

123
00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:42.980
How did my dad die?

124
00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:46.120
I must find evidence

125
00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:02.290
Don't be stupid

126
00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:04.320
You will be discovered before you find the evidence.

127
00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:05.390
follow me

128
00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:13.930
I'll help you delay

129
00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:15.090
You have to move quickly

130
00:12:32.720 --> 00:12:33.650
Oh

131
00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:35.530
Miss

132
00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:43.090
My mother said it was not a happy event after all

133
00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:46.130
It's best not to reveal the identities of the guests

134
00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:48.980
So let me ask you to turn off the monitor
Until my sister’s funeral ceremony is over

135
00:12:50.030 --> 00:12:51.570
Then I'll go check with the dean...

136
00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:53.990
Because it's my mother's request
It's not the dean's request

137
00:12:53.990 --> 00:12:55.630
That's why she sent me

138
00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:08.020
My sister is having a funeral. Where did you go?

139
00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:09.370
What about mom?

140
00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:11.680
My sister has become like this, where are you?

141
00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:17.850
Smile, isn’t this what you’re best at?

142
00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:20.060
Ah, no

143
00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:21.530
Should I cry today?

144
00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:24.130
Aren't you a doctor?

145
00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:26.320
Why can't he even save his own daughter?

146
00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:28.680
Do patients dare to come to you for treatment like this?

147
00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:32.310
Forget it, weak kids go early

148
00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:34.610
It’s a relief for parents

149
00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:36.600
Jay, you’ve grown so big

150
00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:38.280
I heard you got good grades

151
00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:41.100
It's really nerve-wracking to have this kind of thing happen to me in my senior year of high school.

152
00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:43.880
Every minute and second during this period is precious

153
00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:48.100
Only students who are cramming need to worry

154
00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:50.000
Even if I don’t study for three days

155
00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:52.140
It won't be affected, right uncle?

156
00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:56.950
Oh my God, this kid is with you
It's like it was carved out of the same mold

157
00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:58.640
Thanks for the compliment

158
00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:12.550
Jay

159
00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:14.760
Dad knows everything

160
00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:17.830
He knows who the "good boys" are

161
00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:21.110
Who is the "bad boy"

162
00:15:46.020 --> 00:15:47.070
How

163
00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:49.580
Can't you figure it out?

164
00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:51.450
Do you want my help?

165
00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:52.740
Are you here specifically to show off?

166
00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:54.820
Now is not the time to sit around in a daze, right?

167
00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:57.070
I don't need your help, get out

168
00:15:57.070 --> 00:15:58.410
Get out of here

169
00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:00.330
Get out of here

170
00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:03.630
Go away…

171
00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:05.640
Get out of here

172
00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:28.420
I can't cry, absolutely not

173
00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:33.400
Because dads don't give gifts to crying children

174
00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.910
This sounds like the lyrics to a Christmas song

175
00:16:46.910 --> 00:16:48.240
but what is the gift

176
00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:51.400
Sister Jina, do you want any gifts?

177
00:17:05.110 --> 00:17:07.360
I don't know either

178
00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:08.450
But Liu Jiena is very similar to her father

179
00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:12.170
Very obsessed with birthdays and Christmas
There are various anniversaries

180
00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:36.610
The day before last year’s university entrance exam…

181
00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.070
It's November 15th

182
00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:44.040
♫On the abandoned road♫

183
00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:52.420
♫I can’t bear it and want to cry♫

184
00:18:57.140 --> 00:19:02.830
♫Can’t understand why I fell in love silently♫

185
00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:41.090
No Seulgi

186
00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:59.410
aunt

187
00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:05.450
Liu Jiena

188
00:20:10.870 --> 00:20:13.110
A woman’s sixth sense is always very accurate

189
00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:16.030
Although I don’t want to take it to heart

190
00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:20.340
[Teacher, this keychain is like my guardian angel]

191
00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:22.690
but no way

192
00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:26.560
That kid…

193
00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:30.530
Always around us

194
00:20:32.060 --> 00:20:35.060
[I will arrive later
I will bring your husband’s mobile phone over]

195
00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:35.510
After your father passed away...

196
00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:38.110
those weird things that happened

197
00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.390
At first…

198
00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:46.550
I thought it was the kid who did it

199
00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:52.260
[Liu Jiena is dead]

200
00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:56.550
But maybe Zena wants to tell us something.

201
00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:11.790
Please give way

202
00:21:59.150 --> 00:22:01.410
Who doesn't know that they accused you of stealing drugs at that time?

203
00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:04.110
Just to force me to compromise and sign a settlement document

204
00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:08.960
You won't...sign it?

205
00:22:09.940 --> 00:22:11.110
No

206
00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:16.770
I insist not to sign

207
00:22:18.050 --> 00:22:20.100
They actually asked me
Is it because I am your stepmother?

208
00:22:22.290 --> 00:22:24.030
Do you think so too?

209
00:22:24.870 --> 00:22:25.830
No

210
00:22:25.830 --> 00:22:27.390
you did the right thing

211
00:22:29.440 --> 00:22:31.140
where are you going

212
00:22:32.310 --> 00:22:33.540
Please help me get it

213
00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:34.250
And…

214
00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:36.440
Please help stop the lawyer and don't let her follow you.

215
00:22:37.620 --> 00:22:38.790
Seulgi

216
00:22:38.790 --> 00:22:39.650
Me?

217
00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:50.820
scared me

218
00:22:51.610 --> 00:22:52.760
what are you doing

219
00:22:52.760 --> 00:22:54.180
You also know the truth of the matter, right?

220
00:22:54.180 --> 00:22:55.200
what

221
00:22:55.200 --> 00:22:57.090
Don't try to lie to me

222
00:22:57.710 --> 00:23:01.020
I know the rent owed by Sister Xiuzhen and the credit account
You paid it back for her

223
00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:03.770
so

224
00:23:05.490 --> 00:23:07.790
Are you here to see her off on her last journey today?

225
00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:12.850
If there is no one to handle it, forget about the funeral...

226
00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:15.790
She can only lie in the icehouse all the time
rotting alone

227
00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:18.390
At least now she got on the hearse in style.

228
00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:21.500
You should think so too

229
00:23:23.710 --> 00:23:25.560
do you really think so

230
00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:27.690
If there is any humanity left

231
00:23:27.690 --> 00:23:31.400
You should be more concerned about sister Xiuzhen's death
It's okay to feel guilty

232
00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:39.660
Yes, if you have a conscience
We would not have been induced to take drugs in the first place

233
00:23:41.060 --> 00:23:41.880
Hello

234
00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:43.680
Get off the bus

235
00:23:44.930 --> 00:23:47.140
You’re not here just for Xiuzhen, right?

236
00:24:03.620 --> 00:24:05.920
These X-rays cannot be used as evidence

237
00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:07.170
why

238
00:24:07.170 --> 00:24:08.710
why not

239
00:24:08.710 --> 00:24:11.780
Even if you are right
This is really a college entrance exam question

240
00:24:11.780 --> 00:24:15.660
There is no way to prove that he was disemboweled.
Died while taking things out

241
00:24:15.660 --> 00:24:20.830
Concealing the patient’s true condition
It is indeed medical negligence.

242
00:24:20.830 --> 00:24:23.960
But it must be directly proven that these actions resulted in death
The difficulty is too high

243
00:24:24.490 --> 00:24:27.140
Not to mention proving that they had the intent to kill.

244
00:24:28.000 --> 00:24:29.470
Such an inference is too radical

245
00:24:29.710 --> 00:24:31.340
There are hundreds of these vinyl records

246
00:24:31.340 --> 00:24:32.760
On his side…

247
00:24:35.230 --> 00:24:36.580
Kill...

248
00:24:37.330 --> 00:24:39.090
while listening to music

249
00:24:39.090 --> 00:24:41.510
Maybe I heard it when I was rescuing people.

250
00:24:42.590 --> 00:24:45.340
have you heard this song

251
00:24:45.340 --> 00:24:46.300
Yeah

252
00:24:47.240 --> 00:24:48.530
It's a song by Lucid Fall

253
00:24:48.530 --> 00:24:50.050
Sister Jenna likes it very much...

254
00:24:50.390 --> 00:24:52.010
Oh my god

255
00:24:52.010 --> 00:24:55.090
That means the things written in the diary are true.

256
00:24:55.090 --> 00:24:57.570
She was actually taken into the operating room

257
00:24:58.560 --> 00:25:01.250
There are no monitors in the operating room

258
00:25:01.250 --> 00:25:03.520
There must be testimony from the parties involved

259
00:25:03.520 --> 00:25:08.770
Or at least be able to prove it
The diary was written by Jina

260
00:25:08.770 --> 00:25:11.970
But the only witness is gone

261
00:25:23.240 --> 00:25:24.720
what is this

262
00:25:24.720 --> 00:25:27.210
I received it after my husband died.

263
00:25:27.210 --> 00:25:28.370
Sender…

264
00:25:28.370 --> 00:25:30.930
Know the relationship between Jie Na and him

265
00:25:30.930 --> 00:25:34.260
Could this person be another witness?

266
00:25:34.930 --> 00:25:37.530
Maybe it was someone who was in the operating room at the time.

267
00:25:37.530 --> 00:25:38.870
Or people who are in the dormitory where the entrance exam questions are asked

268
00:25:38.870 --> 00:25:41.320
Maybe someone from school

269
00:25:43.130 --> 00:25:45.060
If Anonymous really knows key information

270
00:25:45.060 --> 00:25:46.920
It should be written in the letter

271
00:25:47.600 --> 00:25:50.310
Choosing to be anonymous means there is a reason
He doesn't want to reveal his identity

272
00:25:50.310 --> 00:25:55.340
Generally, even if the whistleblower is found in such a case,
It is also difficult to persuade the other party to testify in court

273
00:25:57.610 --> 00:25:59.610
When is our next court date?

274
00:26:00.200 --> 00:26:01.430
What's wrong

275
00:26:01.840 --> 00:26:03.920
I understand you don't want to give up hope

276
00:26:03.920 --> 00:26:08.340
But as I said just now, based on this evidence alone
There is no way to prove that he was killed

277
00:26:09.090 --> 00:26:11.550
Unless the deceased can come back and testify personally

278
00:26:37.430 --> 00:26:39.450
Stop playing detective games

279
00:26:39.450 --> 00:26:41.250
Concentrate on preparing for college entrance exams

280
00:26:46.470 --> 00:26:47.970
if i were a lawyer

281
00:26:47.970 --> 00:26:51.360
A key witness like me
There should be many questions to ask

282
00:26:54.340 --> 00:26:55.920
But mom doesn’t seem to be like this

283
00:26:56.220 --> 00:26:56.930
Also

284
00:26:56.930 --> 00:26:59.800
You're already into this kind of thing
I'm not interested in a medical lawsuit that makes no money, right?

285
00:26:59.800 --> 00:27:01.690
But he pretends to be considerate of his client

286
00:27:01.690 --> 00:27:02.900
Pretending to be a good lawyer...

287
00:27:02.900 --> 00:27:05.420
-Cui Jing…
-You do the same to me

288
00:27:05.420 --> 00:27:06.540
Pretending to be a good mother

289
00:27:06.540 --> 00:27:08.000
Pretending to be a decent parent

290
00:27:08.000 --> 00:27:09.270
But in fact they are all fake

291
00:27:09.840 --> 00:27:14.290
You don't want to know how I know
Is there a relationship between Teacher Yu Daohe and Liu Jiena?

292
00:27:15.640 --> 00:27:16.390
Yeah

293
00:27:17.650 --> 00:27:19.100
I don't want to know at all

294
00:27:24.590 --> 00:27:25.530
you may not know

295
00:27:25.530 --> 00:27:27.190
My hobby is masturbation

296
00:27:27.190 --> 00:27:28.910
That day I ran to school in the middle of the night to masturbate

297
00:27:28.910 --> 00:27:30.110
Because the night before the exam

298
00:27:30.110 --> 00:27:32.590
Masturbating in the classroom helps me feel less anxious

299
00:27:32.590 --> 00:27:35.880
Just like that, I happened to bump into him
Teacher Yu Daohe and Liu Jiena together

300
00:27:36.150 --> 00:27:37.880
I wanted to tell someone about this

301
00:27:37.880 --> 00:27:39.380
But if you say it out loud, people will definitely ask

302
00:27:39.380 --> 00:27:41.360
Why were you there at that time?

303
00:27:41.900 --> 00:27:45.100
I can't answer it at all
So I can only stay silent

304
00:27:46.590 --> 00:27:50.050
I really want Jay to die

305
00:27:51.070 --> 00:27:53.820
Without her, I would have won first place

306
00:27:54.360 --> 00:27:58.580
Because of her, no one will ever notice me
I've really had enough

307
00:28:08.410 --> 00:28:10.650
When I met Sister Jina on the day of school anniversary

308
00:28:12.740 --> 00:28:14.370
I told her...

309
00:28:14.370 --> 00:28:15.480
I know everything

310
00:28:15.480 --> 00:28:18.910
if she doesn't tell the truth
I will tell everything

311
00:28:21.110 --> 00:28:24.130
But she died

312
00:28:24.130 --> 00:28:27.190
I'm scared every day now
I think it's my fault

313
00:28:27.190 --> 00:28:30.160
But you, the mother, can only ask me to study.

314
00:28:31.630 --> 00:28:33.310
Liu Jiena's death

315
00:28:33.310 --> 00:28:35.170
It has nothing to do with you

316
00:28:35.390 --> 00:28:38.220
The same goes for the death of teacher Yu Daohe

317
00:28:38.220 --> 00:28:40.930
You will never testify in court

318
00:28:40.930 --> 00:28:45.860
So you are not allowed to say these words to anyone.

319
00:28:46.720 --> 00:28:48.240
Did you hear that? Cui Jing

320
00:28:49.280 --> 00:28:53.200
This is the advice your lawyer mother gave you.

321
00:29:06.820 --> 00:29:10.740
[Business Club]

322
00:29:11.540 --> 00:29:12.910
Sister, you are here

323
00:29:24.790 --> 00:29:26.300
Can't you get zopiclone?

324
00:29:26.300 --> 00:29:27.500
Sleeping pills?

325
00:29:27.500 --> 00:29:29.510
I'll go find out

326
00:29:29.510 --> 00:29:32.620
Don't sell to anyone else. Give me all the goods.

327
00:29:32.620 --> 00:29:33.980
I'll buy it from you at a high price

328
00:29:33.980 --> 00:29:34.770
Good

329
00:29:35.090 --> 00:29:37.920
Help me buy a pack of cigarettes. No need for change.

330
00:29:38.340 --> 00:29:39.600
thank you

331
00:29:42.550 --> 00:29:44.380
welcome

332
00:29:56.180 --> 00:29:57.840
What are you doing? Is something wrong?

333
00:29:57.840 --> 00:30:01.200
You and Seulgi really have the same chemistry.

334
00:30:01.200 --> 00:30:03.120
Don't compare me to her

335
00:30:03.120 --> 00:30:04.330
I'm much prettier than her

336
00:30:08.920 --> 00:30:11.960
No matter how much I think about it, I don’t think this business is worthwhile.

337
00:30:11.960 --> 00:30:13.970
Kang Suting in the nightclub last time

338
00:30:13.970 --> 00:30:15.000
You took it secretly

339
00:30:15.000 --> 00:30:18.670
Did you see Liu Jiena at Jiangnan Station?
Didn't tell me either

340
00:30:19.110 --> 00:30:21.980
Why cooperate if we are so suspicious of each other?

341
00:30:21.980 --> 00:30:23.670
I might as well do it alone.

342
00:30:23.670 --> 00:30:27.120
Compared to a high school girl like you
I am more persuasive when discussing business

343
00:30:31.920 --> 00:30:35.220
So can you get zopiclone?

344
00:30:35.220 --> 00:30:38.170
If we could control J Medical Center
What are the sleeping pills?

345
00:30:38.640 --> 00:30:40.020
Just wait

346
00:30:41.260 --> 00:30:42.470
But…

347
00:30:42.470 --> 00:30:46.070
A model student from a wealthy family like Jai Yi
Why sell medicine?

348
00:30:46.820 --> 00:30:47.990
Hey, don't try to understand her

349
00:30:47.990 --> 00:30:50.210
Her brain structure is different from ours

350
00:30:50.210 --> 00:30:52.870
Don't keep saying "we" and confuse me with you.
Very unpleasant

351
00:30:52.870 --> 00:30:55.140
Aunt, how much are these?

352
00:30:55.970 --> 00:30:57.490
Add another plate of pork blood sausage

353
00:30:57.490 --> 00:30:59.210
That's a total of 5,000 won

354
00:31:05.600 --> 00:31:07.250
thank you

355
00:31:08.990 --> 00:31:11.310
Anyway, you'd better be careful

356
00:31:11.310 --> 00:31:13.830
That person is scarier than you think

357
00:31:13.830 --> 00:31:15.190
Seulgi’s father…

358
00:31:15.190 --> 00:31:16.780
He was the one who killed him, right?

359
00:31:35.850 --> 00:31:38.050
Please keep your promise

360
00:31:42.390 --> 00:31:43.670
I will contact you again

